<title>DENMARK: Maersk buys Estonian firm.</title>
<headline>Maersk buys Estonian firm.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipping and energy group A.P. Moeller said on Monday its Maersk Container Industri unit acquired Estonian engineering firm Balti ES for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>It said Balti ES would provide components and parts for its container production and that the move was intended to strengthen Maersk Container Industri's competitive edge and position in eastern European markets.</p>
<p>Maersk said the takeover was due to have been completed by January 31.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
